---
// Drawn Tugma stereo-pair confirmation: two different Sonos models and the exact command. Made-up data.
---

<div class="t" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of Tugma confirming a stereo pair of a Sonos One and an Era 100, sample data">
  <header>
    <span class="back" aria-hidden="true">‹</span>
    <p class="title">New stereo pair</p>
  </header>

  <div class="pair">
    <div class="spk">
      <span class="box tall"><i></i><i class="s"></i></span>
      <b>One</b>
      <span>Kitchen · Left</span>
    </div>
    <span class="link" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="spk">
      <span class="box"><i></i></span>
      <b>Era 100</b>
      <span>Den · Right</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="note">Different models. The Sonos app won't pair these, but the speakers accept it.</p>

  <div class="plan">
    <p class="k">What Tugma will send</p>
    <code>
      <span>DeviceProperties#AddBondedZones</span>
      <span>→ One (192.168.1.30)</span>
      <span>ChannelMapSet = L:LF,LF;R:RF,RF</span>
    </code>
  </div>

  <p class="snap"><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i> Snapshot saved. You can undo this from Snapshots.</p>

  <div class="actions">
    <span class="ghost">Cancel</span>
    <span class="go">Pair speakers</span>
  </div>
  <span class="tag">Sample data</span>
</div>

<style>
  .t {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    font-size: 4.1026cqw;
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    color: #1b1a17;
    background: #fbf8f3;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6em;
    padding: 0.5em 1.25em 0.4em;
  }
  .back {
    font-size: 1.6em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #0f5e54;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 1.3em;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .pair {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.9em;
    margin: 1.2em 1.25em 0;
    padding: 1.4em 1em 1.1em;
    border-radius: 1.2em;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .spk {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.15em;
  }
  .spk b {
    margin-top: 0.5em;
  }
  .spk > span:last-child {
    font-size: 0.75em;
    color: #6f6a61;
  }
  .box {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 3.6em;
    height: 4.4em;
    border-radius: 0.7em;
    background: #f1ece3;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #e3ddd2;
  }
  .box.tall {
    height: 6em;
  }
  .box i {
    width: 1.8em;
    height: 1.8em;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0f5e54;
  }
  .box i.s {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.9em;
    width: 0.8em;
    height: 0.8em;
  }
  .link {
    width: 3em;
    height: 1.6em;
    margin-bottom: 4em;
    border: 0.18em solid #f2b84b;
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-radius: 3em 3em 0 0;
  }
  .note {
    margin: 0.8em 1.5em 0;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #6f6a61;
  }
  .plan {
    margin: 1em 1.25em 0;
    padding: 0.85em 1em;
    border-radius: 1em;
    color: #e8f3ef;
    background: #12302b;
  }
  .k {
    font-size: 0.68em;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #f2b84b;
  }
  code {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25em;
    margin-top: 0.5em;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.7em;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .snap {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5em;
    margin: 0.9em 1.5em 0;
    font-size: 0.78em;
    color: #0f5e54;
  }
  .snap i {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .actions {
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 1.25em 2.2em;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .actions span {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0.8em 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ghost {
    color: #0f5e54;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #c9d9d4;
  }
  .go {
    color: #fff;
    background: #0f5e54;
  }
  .tag {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.25em;
    top: 0.9em;
    font-size: 0.65em;
    color: #a39c90;
  }
</style>
